section "tome-cults/data/achievements/all.lua"

t("You were not supposed to see that!", "見てはいけなかったのに！", "achievement name")
t("Read a Forbidden Tome.", "禁断の書を１冊読んだ。", "_t")
t("Bookception!", "ブックストア！", "achievement name")
t("Found the Forbidden Tome reward inside the Forbidden Tome: \"Of Knowledge And Horrors\".", "禁断の書：「忌むべき知識の書」の内部で禁断の書を獲得した。", "_t")
t("Recursive Home of Recursion", "回帰関数の中の我が家", "achievement name")
t("Left the Forbidden Tome: \"Home, Horrific Home\" on the floor of The Home Which Is Not.", "禁断の書：「嗚呼おぞましき我が家」を「我が家邪ない場ショ」に置いてきた。", "_t")
t("They Came From Outer Space!", "宇宙からやってきた！", "achievement name")
t("Discovered the true origin of dwarves and drems.", "　ドワーフとドレムの起源を解明した。", "_t")
t("The True Coward", "真の臆病者", "achievement name")
t("Win without having saved Kroshkkur, Derth, the lost merchant, Melinda and lady Aeryn.", "クロシュカー、ダース、捕らわれた商人、メリンダ、エアリンの誰も救えぬまま勝利。", "_t")
t("Sequence Master", "紋章の解読者", "achievement name")
t("Use 5 different glyph sequences.", "　グリフの組み合わせを５つ起動。", "_t")
t("Is that how it feels to be an escort quest?!", "エスコートされるとはこういうことか！？", "achievement name")
t("Got saved from death in the Godfeaster by Malyu and managed to escape.", "マルユーの導きで神喰らいの体内から無事脱出した。", "_t")
t("Not Really Yourself", "自分じゃない自分", "achievement name")
t("Let a parasitic horror take over your body and watch it grow in power.", "寄生体に体を預け、成長するのを見た。", "_t")
t("Myths of an age past", "太古の神話", "achievement name")
t("Learned all there is to learn about the Gods and the Godslayers.", "神々と神殺しについて全て学んだ。", "_t")
t("Dethroned", "行かせねえよ？", "achievement name")
t("Vanquished the Glass Golem without letting it use the glass throne to heal.", "硝子ゴーレムを玉座につかせずに倒した。", "_t")
t("A View From The Gallery", "高みの見物", "achievement name")
t("Briefly lived as a lowly halfling during the time of the Sher'tuls.", "シェール・タルの時代における卑小なハーフリングの人生を追体験した。", "_t")
t("Entropy's End", "エントロピーの終焉", "achievement name")
t("Destroyed the Hypostasis of Entropy.", "エントロピーの化身を撃破した。", "_t")

