section "tome-cults/data/birth/demented.lua"

t("Demented", "変異系", "birth descriptor name")
t("The thirst for knowledge is seen by most arcane users as as good thing.", "　魔術の実践者は知識欲を良しとするものがほとんどだ。", "_t")
t("But some take it too far, some delve into lost knowledge. They may gain huge power from it, but at what cost?", "　だが限度を超え、失われし知識を追い求める者もいる。確かにそうした者達は大いなる力を手にするだろう。だがその代償は？", "_t")
t("Writhing One", "ミュータント", "birth descriptor name")
t("Writhing Ones know that what we call #{italic}#horrors#{normal}# hold the key to some ancient knowledge and power from the Age of Haze and they are ready to do anything to access it.", "　「霧の時代」を起源とする太古の大いなる知と力。ミュータント達は我々が#{italic}#ホラー#{normal}#と呼ぶ存在がその鍵であることを知っています。太古の知識を得るためなら如何なる犠牲も厭わない覚悟です。", "_t")
t("In their lust for power they somehow lost a part of themselves, turning more and more into the horrors they study.", "　力を求める過程で、彼らは体の一部を何らかの形で失いました。研究対象のホラーにだんだんと近づいていったのです。", "_t")
t("Most of them forgo an entire arm to turn it into a deadly tentacle.", "　ほとんどのミュータントは片腕が丸ごと凶悪な触手に変異しています。", "_t")
t("Some are even known to never leave their sanctuary without their own worm that walks friend.", "　さらに、どこへ行くにも必ず同輩の『蟲』を伴うタイプもいることが知られています。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Strength and Magic", "　腕力と魔力が重要です。", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Stat modifiers:", "#GOLD#能力修正:", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +3 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *腕力＋３　耐久＋３", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +3 Magic, +0 Willpower, +0 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# +3", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇：#LIGHT_BLUE#＋３", "_t")
t("Cultist of Entropy", "エントロピーカルト", "birth descriptor name")
t("Everything ends eventually. Harness this inevitability.", "　全てのものには終わりがある。その宿命を制御せよ。", "_t")
t("Cultists of Entropy are doomed beings which have unlocked the secrets of using entropy as a weapon. Their spells cause their bodies to wither away from entropic backlash, but they have learned how to resist this backlash and even pass it onto their foes.", "　エントロピーを武器にして戦う術を解き明かした、忌まわしき者達です。彼らの体は魔法を使う毎にエントロピー反動に侵食されていきます。しかし彼らはこの反動に耐え、あまつさえ敵へ押し付ける手段を心得ています。", "_t")
t("Their most important stats are: Magic and Cunning", "　魔力と賢さが重要です。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Strength, +0 Dexterity, +0 Constitution", "#LIGHT_BLUE#", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE# * +6 Magic, +0 Willpower, +3 Cunning", "#LIGHT_BLUE# *魔力＋６　賢さ＋３", "_t")
t("#GOLD#Life per level:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "#GOLD#レベル毎ＨＰ上昇:#LIGHT_BLUE# -4", "_t")

