section "tome-cults/data/chats/fanged-collar.lua"

t("#{italic}##GREY#You feel the creeping blackness of oblivion overtaking you. Somehow, the darkness does not completely enclose around you. Something else is here with you. You feel as though it wishes to help you. Wordlessly, it reassures you that everything will be fine and that it can help you escape your fate. You only have to say yes.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#　真っ黒な死が徐々に体を包み込んでいく。だがなぜか、それはすんでの所で止まっていた。近くに何かがいる。まるでこちらを助けたがっているような感じだ。言葉に出しているわけではないが「何も問題はない。この窮地から救ってやる」と。イエスと答えるしかない。", "_t")
t("Silently you agree. You want to live!", "同意する。死にたくない！", "_t")
t("Silently you refuse, the presence creeps you out too much.", "拒否する。得体の知れない奴だ。", "_t")
t("#{italic}##GREY#The presence shirks back sadly, but you feel like it has respected your decision. It allows you to find the peace that only death can give.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#　そいつは悲しげに身をすくめた。だが、こちらの意思は尊重してくれるようだ。死ぬことでしか得られない平穏を邪魔することはない。#{normal}#", "_t")
t("[die]", "息を引き取る", "_t")
t("#{italic}##GREY#You do not want to die. Without a second thought, you accept its offer. Happily, the presence begins to do... something. You start to wake up and you feel life returning to your limbs. However, you have a splitting headache and your neck won't stop hurting. Just what did the presence do to bring you back from the brink?#{normal}#", "#{italic}##GREY#　死にたくはない。一も二もなく同意する。そいつは喜んで・・・何かを始めた。意識がはっきりとし、四肢に力が戻ってくる。だが、頭が割れそうだ。首も痛む。あいつは自分を蘇生するのに一体何をやったんだ？#{normal}#", "_t")
t("...", "・・・", "_t")
t("#CRIMSON#Strange... You're pretty sure you died, but you're still here. It does feel like something important is missing, however. Your neck also feels incredibly sore and you have a splitting headache. Somehow, you get the subtle impression that you shouldn't look in a mirror anytime soon.", "#CRIMSON#　妙だ・・・確かに死んだはずなのに、こうして生きている。だが、何大事なものを失くしたような。首がやたらと痛むし、頭痛が酷い。どうも、鏡を見るのは覚悟を決めてからの方がいい気がする。", "log")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/godfeaster-malyu-escaped.lua"

t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#Fresh air!#{normal}##LAST#
Nice job! You handled yourself a lot better than I thought you would. Now, usually I get a reward... What? Why are you looking at me like that? I'm obviously the one who saved you here. It's customary for adventurers to get rewarded when they do a good deed.]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#「空気がおいしぃぃぃぃぃぃぃ！」#{normal}##LAST#
	「やったね！　思ってたよりできるじゃない。じゃあ、いつも通り報酬を・・・え？　何よその目は？
	わたしのおかげで助かったんでしょ。良いことをしたら報酬を頂く。冒険者にとっては当たり前の話でしょ。]], "_t")
t("[Offer to teach her '%s'.]", "%sを教える]", "tformat")
t("[Offer her stat increases.]", "能力を増加させてやる", "_t")
t("[Offer her nothing.]", "謝礼はしない", "_t")
t("Oh this will sure come in handy! Thanks!", "「きっと役に立つわ！　アリガト！」", "_t")
t("Take care!", "「じゃあね！」", "_t")
t("I always did want to learn how to do these kind of things!", "「こういうのどうやったらいいのかずっと気になってたんだ！」", "_t")
t("Oh, I suddenly feel like I have potential to grow.", "「なんだか急に強くなった気がするわ」", "_t")
t("...Fine, be that way. Good luck out there, though.", "「・・・いいわ、そういうことなら。まあ、元気でね」", "_t")
t("You too!", "「そっちもね！」", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/godfeaster-malyu.lua"

t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As you move you suddenly find yourself entrapped in a hidden digestive sack that seems to void all your abilities!#{normal}##LAST#", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#　先へ進んでいると突如、隠れた消化袋に落ちてしまった。全く身動きが取れない！#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("[try to kick your way out]", "もがいてみる", "_t")
t("[try to cut your way out]", "切り裂いてみる", "_t")
t("[try to shout your way out]", "助けを呼んでみる", "_t")
t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As were starting to lose hope you hear some kind of cutting.#{normal}##LAST#
There's someone else in here?]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#　もう駄目かもしれないと思い始めた時、何かを切り裂く音がした。#{normal}##LAST#
「誰かいるのー？」]], "_t")
t("Who..what.. YES!", "「誰だ・・・一体・・・ここだ！」", "_t")
t([[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#As the sack gets cut and you regain your mobility you see your savior is some kind of adventurer, she was probably eaten by the Godfeaster too.#{normal}##LAST#
This thing ate you too? Hey, at least you've got company. Name's Malyu, I've been stuck in here for a few days now and had to tough it out alone. I was about to go for this thing's brain when you showed up. What say we team up and get out of here together?
]], [[#DARK_SEA_GREEN##{italic}#　消化袋が切断され、身体に自由が戻る。
	助けてくれたのは同業者のようだ。彼女もまた、「神喰らい」に飲み込まれたのだろう。##LAST#
	
	「アンタもこいつに飲み込まれたの？　まっ、これで相棒ができたってことね。わたしマルユー。ここで数日は足止めを食らってるの。一人で戦うのはキツかったわー。ノウミソの方に行こうかって時にアンタがいたってわけ。どう？　ここから出るまで手を組まない？」
]], "_t")
t("I am glad for the help, you saved me. Let's kill this thing and get out!", "「助けてくれてありがとう。一緒にこいつを始末して脱出しよう！」", "_t")
t("Malyu", "マルユー", "_t")

------------------------------------------------
section "tome-cults/data/chats/space-dwarf-trinket.lua"

t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#Suddenly the strange metallic device emits some beeps and starts to speak. Somehow.#{normal}##LAST#
Uplink established with remote satellite. Activating emergency communication array.
Current user does not match with previous user records. Performing scan.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　突如、金属製の妙な装置が甲高い音を立てて喋りだした。一体何なのだろう。#{normal}##LAST#

　「リモート衛星とのアップリンクを確立。緊急通信ネットワークを起動。現在のユーザーがこれまでのログと一致しません。スキャンを開始します」]], "_t")
t("..what?", "「何だって？」", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature matches expected species, but does not match any identity records in database. Sending information for further analysis.

User added to database. I am now your personal assistant and will help you survive until further assistance can arrive. Enabling protective electromagnetic barrier and real time health monitoring.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　装置がさらに音を立てて喋る。#{normal}##LAST#
　
　「ユーザーの生体情報は既定の種族と一致。データベース内の身元記録とは一致せず。情報を送信し、分析を進めます。ユーザーをデータベースに追加しました。これよりパーソナルアシスタントとしてお手伝いします。救援が到着するまで一緒に頑張りましょう。電磁保護バリアを起動。リアルタイムヘルスモニタリングを開始します」]], "_t")
t("Expected species?", "「既定の種族？」", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature indicates dangerous degeneration of genome due to unknown factors. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　装置がさらに音を立てて喋る。#{normal}##LAST#
　
　「ユーザーの生体情報に深刻な遺伝情報の異常を検知。原因は不明です。情報を送信し、分析を進めます」]], "_t")
t("Genome?", "「遺伝情報？」", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
No signs of life detected. User appears to be still moving despite absence of living tissue. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　装置がさらに音を立てて喋る。#{normal}##LAST#
	
　「生命反応なし。生体組織が存在しないにも関わらずユーザーは活動中。情報を送信し、分析を進めます」.]], "_t")
t("Never seen an undead have you?", "「まさか不死者を知らないのか？」", "_t")
t([[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The device beeps again and speaks.#{normal}##LAST#
User's biological signature does not match any currently known species in database. Sending information for further analysis.]], [[#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　装置がさらに音を立てて喋る。#{normal}##LAST#
	
　「ユーザーの生体情報はデータベース内における既知の種族と一致しませんでした。情報を送信し、分析を進めます]], "_t")
t("Database?", "「データベース？」", "_t")
t("#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#The machine beeps twice, then goes completely silent. Any further attempts to get it to speak prove futile.#{normal}##LAST#", "#YELLOW_GREEN##{bold}#　装置が二度、甲高い音を立てるとそれっきり反応しなくなった。何をどうやってみてももう喋らない。#{normal}##LAST#", "_t")
t("That was weird...", "「何なんだ一体・・・」", "_t")

