section "tome-cults/data/general/events/space-dwarf-ship.lua"

t("floor", "床", "_t")
t("wall", "壁", "_t")
t("strange metallic capsule", "不思議な金属カプセル", "_t")
t("Strange metallic capsule", "不思議な金属カプセル", "_t")
t("You have already scavenged what you could understand and use.", "　分かる範囲で使えそうなものは全部漁った。", "_t")
t([[The thing in front of you appears to be a strange dome made from green glass. Judging by the crater around it, this dome must have crashed into the earth with tremendous force. Stranger still is the figure seated inside it. It appears to be wearing a suit made of an unknown material and a glass dome over its head. Looking inside the dome, you can plainly see that the figure is a dwarf! There is no mistaking that oversized nose. Judging by the smell, he has been dead for quite some time.

You are fairly sure that the dwarves aren't capable of making something like this and they definitely don't dress like that. So, where did this odd dwarf come from? Taking a closer look, you find a strange device attached to the dwarf's arm. You remove it with no small amount of effort. It is completely unlike anything you have seen before and you're not really sure what to make of it. Perhaps if you hold onto it, you might be able to discern its functionality later.]], [[　眼前に緑のガラスで作った不思議なドームのようなものがある。周囲のクレーターから見るに、とてつもない勢いで地面へ衝突したに違いない。それにも増して奇妙なのは中に鎮座する人影だ。見たこともない素材を使ったスーツを着ており、頭周りはガラスの半球で保護されている。その半球の中はというと、紛れもなくドワーフだ！　あの巨大な鼻は見間違えようもない。臭いから判断して相当前に命を落としたようだ。
					　
　ドワーフにこんなものを作る技術はないはずだ。こんな格好も絶対にしない。なら、この奇妙なドワーフはどこから来たのだろう？　もっとよく調べてみると、片腕に妙な装置がくっついていた。四苦八苦して取り外す。こんな機械は見たこともない。一体何に使うものなのだろう。取っておけば、後々使い道が判るかもしれない。]], "_t")
t("previous level", "前の階層へ", "_t")
t("ladder back to %s", "%sに戻るはしご", "tformat")
t("Eerie Cave", "不気味な洞窟", "_t")
t("eerie cave", "不気味な洞窟", "_t")

