section "tome-cults/data/general/objects/special-misc.lua"

t("Robe of the Worm", "『蟲』のローブ", "entity name")
t("worm", "蟲衣", "entity short_name")
t("Rags of the Sanctuary", "禁所のボロ服", "entity name")
t("rags", "ボロ", "entity short_name")
t("misc", "雑具", "entity type")
t("tool", "道具", "entity subtype")
t("Bizzare Contraption", "★ヘンな装置", "entity name")
t("bizzare contraption", "★ヘンな装置", "_t")
t("This strange device appears to be entirely mechanical in nature, but you cannot understand how any of the components are supposed to work. There does appear to be some sort of metallic grid in its side which sometimes emits strange noises.", "　変わった装置だ。完全に機械仕掛けで動いているが、仕組みは皆目見当もつかない。脇に金網のようなものがあり、そこから時折奇妙なノイズが聞こえてくる。", "_t")
t("10% chance when hit to absorb the whole blow. This effect has a 30 turn cooldown.", "１０％の確率で攻撃全てを無効化。この効果には３０ターンのクールダウンが存在。", "_t")
t("The Bizzare Contraption fully absorbs the blow (%0.2f damage absorbed).", "ヘンな装置が攻撃を無効化した( %0.2f ダメージ無効化)", "logSeen")
t("#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#Enabling protective electromagnetic barrier and real time health monitoring.#{normal}#", "#{italic}##LIGHT_GREEN#「電磁バリア起動。リアルタイムヘルスモニタリング開始」#{normal}#", "logPlayer")
t("armor", "防具", "entity type")
t("head", "頭", "entity subtype")
