section "tome-cults/data/general/objects/world-artifacts.lua"

t("Spinal Cage", "★スパインアーマー", "entity name")
t("gross mass of spinal matter", "おぞましい背骨の塊", "_t")
t("A gross mass of spinal matter hastily assembled into armour.", "大量の背骨を適当に組み合わせて作った、おぞましい鎧だ。", "_t")
t("Infused Cerebrum", "★ブレインリンカー", "entity name")
t("a disgusting pile of brain-matter", "不気味な脳髄", "_t")
t("This #{italic}#headwear#{normal}# seems made entirely out of half-rotten brain matter. Do you really want to put that over your head?", "この#{italic}#帽子#{normal}#は腐りかけの脳味噌を丸ごと使用したもののようだ。本気で被るつもりか？", "_t")
t("assault the mind of a foe to utterly dominate it", "敵の精神を攻撃し、完全支配下に置く。", "_t")
t("%s resists the mental assault!", "%sは精神攻撃に抵抗した！", "logSeen")
t("Writhing Ring of the Hunter", "★ハンターリング", "entity name")
t("green slimy ring", "緑のべとべとした指輪", "_t")
t("A writhing mass of tentacles roughtly warped into the form of a ring. A dark malovelant power emanates from it.", "蠢く触手の群体を乱暴に捻じ曲げて指輪の形にしてある。邪悪な力を発しているのが判る。", "_t")
t("When first worn the ring attunes to you, letting you choose a prodigy it will forever grant while worn (can not be changed once chosen, re-wear it to select again if you refused to choose at first).", "最初に装備した際、この指輪は装備者に応じて変化する。すなわち奥義を１つ選択し、以降装備中はそれを習得している扱いになる（一度選択すると選び直せない。装備時に何も選択しなければ、再度装備した時に改めて選択可能", "_t")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#While the ring senses battle it grips your finger so hard you can not take it off.", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#指輪が戦いの気配を感じ取り、指に食い込んだ。これでは外せない。", "logPlayer")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#As you put the %s on your finger, you feel more attuned to the horror within you.", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#%sを指に嵌めると、己の内なる怪物と同化する気がした。", "logPlayer")
t("Staff of Bones", "★ボーンスタッフ", "entity name")
t("bone staff", "骨の杖", "_t")
t("A staff made out of the bones of fallen foes. Disgustingly powerful.", "敵の骨を使って作った杖だ。忌々しいほどに強力である。", "_t")
t("It seems willing and able to talk to you (use Command Staff).", "お喋りがしたいらしい（杖の調整を使ってみよう）", "_t")
t("Growing more powerful? Still pathetic compared to a True Necromancer!", "強くなったって？　真の死霊術死にはまだまだ遠いな！", "_t")
t("Ahh the rush of power... I love that!", "おお、力が流れ込んでくるな・・・実にいい！", "_t")
t("What feeble power you wield now is nothing!", "今のお前のちっぽけな力など何ほどのものでもない！", "_t")
t("Yes yes you've leveled up, so what?", "オーケー、オーケー。レベルアップしたね。で？", "_t")
t("One more level, that's hardly impressive you know?", "１レベル上がったからって大騒ぎするほどのことじゃないだろ？", "_t")
t("If you weren't so useless I'd be nearly impressed by that new level...", "もう少しマシになってりゃ、「レベルアップおめでとう」くらいは言ってやれるんだがな・・・", "_t")
t("KILL! KILL!", "殺せ！　殺せ！", "_t")
t("We require more souls!", "もっと魂を！", "_t")
t("Destroy them all! OBEY!", "皆殺しだ！　言うとおりにしろ！", "_t")
t("FEED ME!", "力をよこせ！", "_t")
t("I nee ..err.. you need more souls. Yes you...", "魂をよこ・・・あー・・・魂を集めたほうがいいぞ。きっと役に立つ・・・", "_t")
t("Pain and misery, spread them!", "ありったけの痛みと苦しみを与えてやれ！", "_t")
t("I love the smell of a fresh corpse.", "新鮮な死体の香りはイイ。", "_t")
t("Splatter me with the blood of our foes!", "奴らの血で俺を洗ってくれ！", "_t")
t("That one wasn't such an impressive kill...", "今の手際は今一つだったな・・・", "_t")
t("Getting a bit sloppy on the kills no?", "コロシにはもう飽きてきたってか？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"Of Knowledge And Horrors\"", "★禁断の書：「忌むべき知識の書」", "entity name")
t("A gross tome of lost knowledge. Even touching it makes you feel sick.", "不気味な書だ。失われし知識が記してある。触っただけで気分が悪くなってくる。", "_t")
t([[The book of horrors,
the book of terrors,
the book of pain,
the book of gain,
the book of insanity,
the book of lunacy.

It which reads the book shall know pain beyond pain.
Read now for a fate worse than death inside awaits.
]], [[これなるは戦慄と恐怖の書苦難を与え、知識をもたらす世の常を超えた狂気の書なり
	
　目を通せば想像を絶する苦しみが見舞うだろう　さあページを開くがいい　死すら救いと思えるような　末路がお前を待っている
]], "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"The Day It Came\"", "★禁断の書：「かの者との邂逅した日」", "entity name")
t("The cover of this tome is old and withered. As you hold it, you get the impression of many things. Despair, misery, desperation and hopelessness all assail you at once. Something about the book also promises great power, but at what cost?", "この書の表紙は古びてボロボロになっている。手に取ると、様々な感覚が湧き上がってくる。絶望、悲嘆、憤怒、諦念。それらがない交ぜになって押し寄せるのだ。一方で、この書を読めば大いなる力が授かるに違いないという予感もある。だが、一体何を支払うことになるのだろうか？", "_t")
t("In the Age of Pyre, it seemed that the world was ending to many of Eyal's inhabitants. The destruction caused by the Spellblaze left the land withered and scorched. Food was scarce, paranoia was rampant and everyone was desperate. For a select few, their salvation came from an unlikely visitor. An entity they simply came to knew as The Teacher visited Eyal from somewhere beyond the stars, emerging from an ancient Sher'tul farportal. It discovered a group of survivors in the depths of Eyal which begged it for knowledge, anything they could use as a weapon against the horrors ravaging their world.", "　黄昏の時代、イヤルの人々にとってこの世は終末の様相を呈していた。魔法大禍の惨劇により、大地は不毛の焦土と化したのだ。食料は底を尽き、人心は大いに乱れ、皆が絶望の淵にいた。その中でごく一部、予期せぬ来訪者に救われた者達がいる。彼らの間でその来訪者は、ただ「師匠」と呼ばれるようになった。この者は星々の彼方よりイヤルにやってきた。古のシェール・タルが作りし大ポータルより姿を現したのだ。「師匠」はイヤルの地底に逃れた一団と出会い、彼らは「師匠」に教えを請うた。「とにかく、この世界に跋扈する化物共と戦う力が欲しい」と。", "_t")
t("Hithre died. Somehow this is not what should have happened.", "　ハイザーが命を落とした。彼女はそこでは死ぬはずのない人物だったようだ。", "_t")
t("Hithre", "ハイザー", "_t")
t("Main protagonist", "主人公", "_t")
t("The importance of power (+3% spell critical chance)", "力の重要性 (魔法クリティカル＋３％)", "_t")
t("The importance of thought (+10 spell save)", "思考の重要性（魔法セーブ＋１０）", "_t")
t("The importance of magic (+5 magic)", "魔力の重要性（魔力＋５）", "_t")
t("The importance of wisdom (+5 willpower)", "知恵の重要性（意志＋５）", "_t")
t("The Day It Came", "邂逅の日", "_t")
t("This chapter has taught your some important lesson. What did you learn?", "　この章では実に重要な教訓を学んだ。何を理解しただろうか？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"A View From The Gallery\"", "★禁断の書：「高みの見物」", "entity name")
t("The story of Grung, a halfling separated from his tribe that is just trying to survive while a terrible war, very long ago, rages on.", "グラングというハーフリングの物語だ。彼は独力で、とにかく生き延びようと足掻いていた。凄まじい戦いが繰り広げられた、遥か古代の話である。", "_t")
t("It's a cold night and you did not find anything to eat during the day. Your fur pelt doesn't do much to keep the cold out either. You're about to go out to hunt, but everyone else has warned you that you must not do that. The night is dangerous and there appears to be strange lights in the sky. An ill omen, to say the least. Food has been hard to come by lately, so everyone is just as famished as you are.", "　今夜は寒い。昼間は食べ物がまるで見つからなかった。おまけに毛皮を着ていてもえらく冷える。これから狩りに行くところだが、皆口をそろえて「やめておけ」と言う。夜間の外出は危険だ。それに天空では不気味な光がいくつも瞬いている。どう考えても不吉な兆しだ。近頃はなかなか食料が手に入らない。皆一様に腹を空かせていた。", "_t")
t("Poor Grung. All he wanted was food, but what he found instead was death.", "　かわいそうなグラング。食料が欲しかっただけなのに、代わりに命を落とすことになるなんて。", "_t")
t("Grung", "グラング", "_t")
t("The importance of evading blows (+10 defense)", "回避（回避＋１０）", "_t")
t("The importance of speed (+10% movement speed)", "速度（移動速度＋１０％）", "_t")
t("The importance of reflexes (+5 dexterity)", "反射神経（機敏＋５）", "_t")
t("The importance of a honed mind (+5 cunning)", "抜け目のなさ（賢さ＋５）", "_t")
t("A View From The Gallery", "「高みの見物」", "_t")
t("This chapter has taught your some survival tips. What did you learn?", "　この章ではサバイバルテクニックを幾つか学んだ。何が身についただろうか？", "_t")
t("Forbidden Tome: \"The Illusory Castle\"", "★禁断の書：「幻影城」", "entity name")
t("The tome in front of you seems to be as much made of dreamstuff as it is from leather and parchment. Crystalline shards dance underneath its surface, giving you an impression of a world altering itself to the tune of some indiscernable logic.", "　目の前の書は羊皮紙を皮で綴じたものだがその実、幻想の産物に思える。内側でクリスタル片が乱舞しており、計り知れないルールに基づいて変化する異世界といった感じだ。", "_t")
t([[The world inside the tome depicts a castle. At least, it gives the impression of a castle. It has a dreamlike feeling to it, enough so to make you wonder if you're awake or not. The glass walls shimmer brightly with countless brilliant lights, reflected from some unknown source.

Judging by the way the walls constantly shift and change themselves, you can be certain that this place will be difficult to explore.]], [[　書の内部世界は城になっている。まあ、とにかく城に見える。幻想的な雰囲気で、まるで夢の中にいるような気分だ。ガラスの壁が眩い光を受けて一面に輝いている。光源がどうなっているのかは解らない。
　
　ここの壁は始終ひとりでに動き、変化する。この有様を見れば、探索困難であることは想像に難くない。]], "_t")
t("misc", "雑具", "entity type")
t("gross", "グロテスク", "entity subtype")
t("Cut Drem Arm", "★ドレムの片腕", "entity name")
t("bloody arm", "血まみれの腕", "_t")
t("The arm appears desiccated, but you swear that you see something wriggling underneath its ashen skin.", "この腕は干からびてしまっているようだ。だが、灰色をした皮膚の下で何かが蠢めているのが分かる。間違いない。", "_t")
t("The arm can sometimes reach out to a foe in radius 5 and grab it to you with a tentacle pull. This action is not your own choice, it has a mind of its own.", "この腕は時折、半径５マス以内の相手を触手で掴んで引き寄せる。これは装備者の意向を無視して実行される。腕そのものが意志を持っているのである。", "_t")
t("#DARK_SEA_GREEN#The %s reaches for %s with a tentacle!", "#DARK_SEA_GREEN#%sが%sに触手を伸ばした！", "logSeen")
t("Monolith Armour", "★モノリスアーマー", "entity name")
t("black stone armour", "黒い石の鎧", "_t")
t("This 'armour' seems to mostly consist of chunks of a rune etched stone somehow fused with a highly flexible black mesh. The titanic pieces of stone would undoubtedly deflect any blow thrown at you, but you would need obscene strength just to move while wearing this. The glyphs and runes carved into the chunks sometimes light up of their own accord, letting out small bursts of magic.", "この「鎧」の大部分はルーンを刻んだ石で構成されている。それらがどういうわけか、伸縮性に富む黒い繊維と網目状に融合しているのだ。この巨大な石の塊を着ていれば、どんな攻撃を受けてもどこ吹く風だ。ただ、これを装備する以上、歩くだけでも大変な体力を要するに違いない。石に刻んだ紋章やルーンは時折ひとりでに光り輝き、小規模な魔力の爆発を起こす。", "_t")
t([[15% chance when hit to shatter reality around you creating rifts to help you (free cast of a Reality Fracture talent, level 4). This effect has a 30 turns cooldown.
#PURPLE#If your constitution drops below requirement while using it, it is so heavy you will automatically unequip it. Beware.#LAST#]], [[１５％の確率で攻撃を受けた時、周囲の空間を破壊して断裂を生成し、利用する。
（タレントレベル４の「宙空崩壊」）この効果には３０ターンのクールダウンが存在。
\n#PURPLE#装備中に耐久の値が装備要求値を下回ると、重さに耐えきれず自動的に脱いでしまう。注意すること。#LAST#]], "_t")
t("#LIGHT_RED#Your %s is too heavy to carry with your punny constitution anymore. You remove it.", "#LIGHT_RED#今の貧弱な体には%sは重過ぎる。脱ぐことにした。", "logPlayer")
t("Fanged Collar", "ファングカラー", "entity name")
t("a necklace with fangs", "牙の生えたネックレス", "_t")
t("This strange creature seems to melt around your neck, keeping its mouth open just wide enough so that its teeth do not touch you. You suspect that in the case your head somehow goes missing, the creature is going to make itself at home in your neck stump.", "この奇怪な生物は装備者の首にぴったりとくっつくようだ。だが、ぎりぎりのところで牙が触れないように口を開く。何かの拍子に首を落とされたら、この生き物はその切り口を新居にするつもりじゃないだろうか。", "_t")
t("You have died, but that does not bother the collar at all...", "命を落としたが、ファングカラーは気にも留めない・・・", "_t")
t("Try to not die...", "死に抗ってみる・・・", "_t")
t("Perseverance", "★忍耐の刃", "entity name")
t("always sharp blade", "毀れ無き刃", "_t")
t([[It is said that the preferred weapons of the krog is a mace in one hand and a sword in the other. One hand to spread the message of the Zigurath, the other to see that message through to the end.
The sword symbolizes the krogs committment to their task of fighting against the forces of the arcane. With each slash the krog would endevor to continue, until at last their opponents would fall.]], "かのクログはいつも片手に剣を持ち、もう一方にメイスを構えていたと言われている。片方の手はジグランスの言葉を広めるため。もう片方はその言葉が完璧に伝わるように。この剣は、件のクログがジグランスの使命に命を捧げた証である。一振りごとに決意を固め、粘り強く敵を殲滅していたのである。", "_t")
t("restore 7 stamina and equilibrium", "スタミナと調和値を７回復する。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#As you wear the sword you feel it attuning to your Krog body, increasing in power!", "#LIGHT_BLUE#剣を手に取ると、クログの肉体に馴染んでいく気がする。力が湧いてきた！", "logPlayer")
t("It is said perseverance comes hand in hand with dedication.", "我が身を惜しまぬ者に忍耐は宿ると謂う。", "_t")
t("#AQUAMARINE#As the twin weapons of the Krogs are reunited you can feel bursting with power!", "#AQUAMARINE#かのクログの武装を揃えると、力が溢れてきた！", "logSeen")
t("#AQUAMARINE#The twin weapons of the Krogs de-power as you separate them.", "#AQUAMARINE#クログの武装を手放すと、溢れていた力が退いていく。", "logPlayer")
t("Dedication", "★献身の槌", "entity name")
t("always blunt mace", "欠けることなきメイス", "_t")
t([[It is said that the preferred weapons of the krog is a mace in one hand and a sword in the other. One hand to spread the message of the Zigurath, the other to see that message through to the end.
The mace symbolizes the krogs willingness to endure until the final blow is struck against the arcane. Commonly the mace would be used to batter a mage senseless, thus preventing them from being able to cast their spells. ]], "かのクログはいつも片手に剣を持ち、もう一方にメイスを構えていたと言われている。片方の手はジグランスの言葉を広めるため。もう片方はその言葉が完璧に伝わるように。このメイスは件のクログが艱難辛苦に耐え、魔法使い共に致命の一撃を加えんとした志の証である。元の所持者は日頃これで、身の程知らずの魔法使いを滅多打ちにしていた。そういう風にして魔法を封じたのだ。", "_t")
t("#LIGHT_BLUE#As you wear the mace you feel it attuning to your Krog body, increasing in power!", "#LIGHT_BLUE#メイスを手に取ると、クログの肉体に馴染んでいく気がする。力が湧いてきた！", "logPlayer")
t("charm", "チャーム", "entity type")
t("totem", "トーテム", "entity subtype")
t("Persistent Will", "★繰り言の杭", "entity name")
t("ever burning stake", "燃え盛る杭", "_t")
t([[During the Age of Dusk a rash of anti-magic activities took place in the Nargol Kingdom immediately after the Spellblaze. Citizens would turn on those with magical powers, burning them alive on stakes of wood. When the authorities found the perpetrators they executed them and planted their heads on stakes throughout their capital city.
Despite this however, the citizenry continued to burn alive the enemies of nature. Unbeknownst to the authorities, the heads of the dead perpetrators continued to spread their message long after their deaths.

This stake of wood appears to one of those used to prop up one of the executed heads. It has seemingly absorbed the will of the head it propped up, and holding it you can hear the Ziguranth's message echo through your mind.]], [[黄昏の時代、魔法大禍直後のナーゴルにおいて、反魔法運動が急激に広まった。住民達は魔法の力を持つ者を敵視し、杭に刺して生きたまま焼いたのである。犯人たちは捕まると処刑され、その首は杭に串刺しとなり首都のそこかしこで晒し物になった。にもかかわらず、国民は大地の敵への火刑をやめようとはしなかった。捕吏の預かり知らぬところで、串刺しになった頭の数々が死後も長らく扇動を続けたのだ。
　この杭はその時代の一本のようだ。刺さっていた首の意志が染み渡っているらしく、手に取るとジグランスの言葉が頭の中に響いてくる。]], "_t")
t("convince all non arcane users in radius 10 to turn on their spellcasting friends for 6 turns (chance increases with your Mindpower)", "半径１０マス以内の魔法を使わない者達を洗脳する。洗脳された者達は６ターンの間、同陣営の魔法使用者に敵対する（成功率は精神パワーに依存）", "tformat")
t("Worm Nest", "★パラサイトローブ", "entity name")
t("disgusting robe", "気持ち悪いローブ", "_t")
t("This unusually thick robe constantly wriggles and squirms. Small worms sometimes pop out of it, dropping to the floor. The worms will cushion attacks against your person, but you somehow do not like the idea of having so many parasitic creatures so close to your vulnerable flesh.", "異常に分厚いローブだ。始終蠢き、甲高い音を発している。時折、小さな芋虫が顔を出し、地面に落ちていく。この芋虫共のおかげで肉体へのダメージが軽減されるはずだ。だが、大事な体に寄生虫の群を纏うのいうのはどうにも。", "_t")
t("#GREEN#The worms embed themselves easily in your mutated skin.", "#GREEN#　ローブのワームたちはこの変異した体に易々と融合した。", "logPlayer")
t("Light of Revelation", "★シンリノトモシビ", "entity name")
t("disturbing lantern", "不気味なランタン", "_t")
t("The \"lantern\" appears to be a glowing shard of a glass-like substance. Despite how bright it is, its light deeply disturbs you. It illuminates everything in its wake, including things which you would rather not see. Part of you wants to throw it away, but another part wants to know the unearthly truths it will reveal to you.", "輝くガラス片といった風な「ランタン」だ。明るさと無関係に、この光を見ると酷く心が乱れる。範囲内をくまなく照らすが、見たくもないものまで映してしまう。投げ捨てたいという気持ちはあるものの、一方で常識を超えた秘密が明らかになるのを期待してしまう。", "_t")
t("Sometimes reveals the hidden truths you'd rather not see.", "時折、見たくもない秘めた真実を暴き出す。", "_t")
t("#YELLOW#Light of Revelation shines on %s revealing its true nature as %s!", "#YELLOW#シンリノトモシビが%sを照らす。%sが正体を現した！", "say")
t("Glowing Core", "★バーニングコア", "entity name")
t("burning core", "燃え盛る核", "_t")
t("This is all that's left of the Searing Horror. Even after its death, the object in your hand glows just as brightly as it did before.", "シアリングホラーを倒した後にこれだけが残った。死してなお、手にしたその輝きは生前と遜色がない。", "_t")
t("Shoes of Moving Slowly", "★低速移動ブーツ", "entity name")
t("restful shoes", "安定ブーツ", "_t")
t([[Fast does not always win.

#GOLD#Rumoured to be able to combine with the Shoes of Moving Quickly.]], [[亀がウサギに勝つこともある。

#GOLD#　★高速移動ブーツと合体できるらしいぞ。]], "_t")
t("Each turn you spend not moving gain a buff for 2 defense and armour. Stacks up to 12 times.", "移動しないターンは回避とアーマーが２上昇。１２回までスタックする。", "_t")
t("combine it with the Shoes of Moving Quickly", "★高速移動ブーツと合体。", "_t")
t("You need to have the Shoes of Moving Quickly in your inventory.", "★高速移動ブーツが所持品にない。", "logPlayer")
t("Shoes of Slowly Moving Quickly", "★高速移動低速ブーツ", "_t")
t("A wonder of footwear! You can set a shoe to stay in place while the other one goes very fast, spinning around to create tornados!", "ブーツが巻き起こす驚異現象！　軸足を固定し、蹴り足を高速移動させてみよう。回転して竜巻が起こせるぞ！", "_t")
t([[Each turn you spend not moving gain a buff for 2 defense and armour. Stacks up to 12 times.
You move 3 spaces at once.]], "移動しないターンは回避とアーマーが２上昇。１２回まで累積する。一度に３マス移動できる。", "_t")
t("As you combine the two pair of shoes you make something marvelous: %s", "２つのブーツを組み合わせ、大発明が完成した: %s", "logPlayer")
t("Rod of Entropy", "★エントロピーロッド", "entity name")
t("light sucking rod", "光を吸うロッド", "_t")
t("This rod seems to make light die around it. You feel tired just looking at it.", "このロッドは周囲の光を消し去ってしまうようだ。見ているだけで疲労を覚えてしまう。", "_t")
t("temporarily causes the target to receive entropic backlash from any healing they receive for %d turns up to %d%% of the healing done. This effect scales with your Magic stat.", "一時的なエントロピー反動を発生させる。対象のＨＰが回復した際、対象は%dターンかけてその %d%% 分のダメージを受ける。効果量は魔力に依存。", "tformat")
t("%s activates %s %s!", "%sは%s %s を起動した！", "logSeen")
t("Seeds of the Black Tree", "★ブラックシード", "entity name")
t("corrupt stone", "邪なる石", "_t")
t("This writhing mass of tentacles appears to have infested a mindstar, creating some bizarre fusion between natural and unnatural. The once clear gem now seems more like a shard of black obsidian with tentacles striking out from it like whips. You do not want to think of the implications of this horror being able to fuse with Nature itself.", "この蠢く触手の群体はマインドスターに寄生しているようだ。正体不明の存在が自然界の産物と奇怪な融合を遂げている。かつて澄み切った宝石だったものが、今ではむしろ黒曜石の破片に近い。触手の群が鞭のように飛び出してくる。この化物が大地そのものと融合できるということはどういうことなのか、考えたくもない。", "_t")
t("15% chance to cast Tendrils Eruption level 3 on your target", "１５％の確率でレベル３のテンタクルバーストを対象に発動。", "_t")
