t("Steal time from others, weakening them to empower yourself.", "　他者の時間を盗み、弱体化させたうえで自身を強化します。", "_t")
t("oblivion", "ホロビ", "talent type")
t("Channel the essence of entropy to reduce your foes to dust.", "　エントロピーの力を注ぎ、敵を塵に変えます。", "_t")
t("rift", "サケメ", "talent type")
t("Tear holes in space and time to unleash devastating forces on your foes.", "　空間に穴を開け、破壊の力を解き放ちます。", "_t")
