section "tome-cults/data/zones/ft-haze-cave/zone.lua"

t("A cave from ages old", "太古の洞窟", "_t")
t("%d Food Collected", "集めた食料 %d", "tformat")
t("Hungry", "ハラペコ", "_t")
t([[It's a cold night and you did not find anything to eat during the day. Your fur pelt doesn't do much to keep the cold out either. You're about to go out to hunt, but everyone else has warned you that you must not do that. The night is dangerous and there appears to be strange lights in the sky. An ill omen, to say the least. Food has been hard to come by lately, so everyone is just as famished as you are.

The many tentacled ones who sometimes come down from the sky to look at you say that they are going to battle with themselves. You did not really understand why they would fight among themselves, even as it tried to explain it to you. You reconsider the idea of going outside when its warnings come across your mind, but the rumbling in your belly renews your resolve. Everyone in your tribe tonight must eat, no matter what.]], [[　今夜は寒い。昼間は食べ物がまるで見つからなかった。おまけに毛皮を着ていてもえらく冷える。これから狩りに行くところだが、皆口をそろえて「やめておけ」と言う。夜間の外出は危険だ。それに天空では不気味な光がいくつも瞬いている。どう考えて不吉な兆しだ。近頃はなかなか食料が手に入らない。皆一様に腹を空かせていた。
　触手を生やした奴らが時々、天から降りてきてこっちのことを調べている。そいつらの言うには「同胞たちと戦うことになった」のだと。なぜ内輪揉めをするのかはよく解らなかった。説明しようとはしてくれたのだが。奴の警告が頭をよぎり、狩りに出かけるのは止めておこうかと逡巡する。だが空きっ腹が鳴り、心が決まった。今夜こそ、集落の皆は何か腹に入れないと。]], "_t")
t("Why is there a dead tentacled one here?", "何で触手のやつがここで死んでるんだ？", "_t")
t("Corpses are raining from the sky...", "空から死体が降り注いでくる・・・", "_t")
t("The many tentacled ones are piling on the ground, forming mass graves.", "触手の奴らが山積みになってる。まるででっかい墓場だ。", "_t")
t("What are these things?!", "こいつら一体何なんだ！？", "_t")
t("Your primitive mind recoils in horror from the thing in front of you.", "（目の前の存在には根源的な恐怖で身が竦む）", "_t")
t("Why are they killing each other? For what reason does this horror have to happen?", "なんで殺し合ってる？　この化物共は一体なんだってこんなことを？", "_t")
t("You have fought against other tribes before, but the bloodshed you saw then is nothing compared to this.", "（以前に他のハーフリング部族と戦ったことはある。だがその時の惨状も今に比べれば何ほどのことでもない）", "_t")
t("You do not have the words you need to articulate your horror.", "（この恐怖を言い表そうにも適切な言葉が見つからない）", "_t")
t("Are the many tentacled ones using these creatures against each another?", "触手共はこの生き物を使って内輪揉めしてるのか？", "_t")
t("Little of what you're seeing makes sense to you. You simply don't have the words to articulate the terror you're feeling.", "（目の前で何が起きているのか全く判らない。この恐怖の前に口をつぐむばかりだ）", "_t")
t("Great blasts of light come from the sky.", "（空でものすごい光がいくつも爆ぜている）", "_t")
t("Indescribable things are emerging from the darkness.", "（闇の中から形容しがたい物共がやってくる）", "_t")
t("Looking up, you see something writhing between the stars. You look away before curiosity gets the better of you.", "（空を見上げると、星々の狭間に蠢くものが見えた。目を逸らし、好奇心を脇へ追いやる）", "_t")
t("The lights nearly blind you as cascades of swirling colours explode in the darkness above your head.", "（夜空で様々な色の光が渦を巻き、次々と爆発していく。とても目を開けて見てられない）", "_t")
t("Terrified by the carnage around it, the rabbit has become easy prey.", "この大騒ぎですっかり怯えていたんだな。今のウサギは楽に捕まった。", "_t")
t("A good little meal, but you will need more than this.", "（少しの足しにはなるだろう。だがもっと大物を捕まえたい）", "_t")
t("Meat has been a rare treat as of late.", "最近じゃ肉を手に入れるのは一苦労だ。", "_t")
t("#ANTIQUE_WHITE#Grung: %s", "#ANTIQUE_WHITE#グラング: %s", "log")

