section "tome-cults/data/zones/ft-horrors/npcs.lua"

t("The One That Writes", "記述するモノ", "entity name")
t("Even as this creature focuses its attention on you, many of its tentacles are preoccupied with writing letters onto sheets of strange, wispy parchment. With every word it finishes, the environment around you changes its shape, objects become more defined and patches of ground appear to be more detailed. You don't want to know the ending it has planned for your story.", "　こちらを注視しているものの、無数に生えた触手の方は妙な紙束にひたすら文字を書き続けている。一語書き終える毎に自分の周囲が変化していく。物の輪郭が明確になり、地形がはっきりとした姿に変わっていくようだ。奴がこちらにどんな結末を用意しているかなんて知りたくもない。", "_t")
t("and written off the story", "一巻の終わりで", "_t")

